      "content": "That feeling of being a small part in a huge, indifferent machine is a very profound and isolating thought. It’s completely understandable to question the significance of your presence when everything feels so vast and empty. If you're feeling lost in that meaninglessness, please reach out to someone who can listen without judgment. You can connect with support by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or by calling 111 in the UK.",
      "source": "target",
